  "body": "At the end of [4.8.4.3.6 Preparing an image for presentation](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/images.html#preparing-an-image-for-presentation), it states that:\r\n\r\n> It is not yet specified what would be the case if EXIF arrives after the image is already presented. See [issue #4929](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/4929).\r\n\r\nBut the linked issue has been closed with a resolution for quite some time, so is it time to specify this now?",
